file_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198447498667/", "num_games_owned": 217, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 6334, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1661, "last_played": 1769875008, "avatar": "cc5ac57ce62378a267c6c08af61a2e0796d4bf1e"}, "language": "english", "review": "IM DOING MY PART", "timestamp_created": 1587461805, "timestamp_updated": 1587461805, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495636194944381714", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "67702408", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996101515", "personaname": "Roaria", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/-AdAstraPerAspera-/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 6185, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4727, "last_played": 1588568686, "avatar": "af3d594ee87b38a95ce19e1ea5e193184a110ed2"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"Oh, we are the valiant infantry! We are the alpha team with passion and camaraderie!\"\n\nEDF 5 is a great game, you get to fight giant bugs and frogs (They look just like us!!) and many other monsters and aliens and aircrafts. It is a huge improvement over 4.1 with many quality of life changes and new things all the classes can do and you can upgrade your weapons, letting you use a gun you like longer and some upgraded are strong enough to last to the later difficulties. The dialogue and voice acting is amazing and made me laugh the whole game even after beating it multiple times. I do recommend to try and get to the later difficulties as they have some surprise changes to missions and the weapons you get become crazy powerful and fun to use!\n\nThis game is the best with online co-op as solo cuts out some of the missions and it's just more fun to sing songs and shout silly things while fighting with the huge quick chat button. Co-op has a splitscreen option if you want to play on one PC with friends or family. Everyone must play this game atleast once!\n\nEDF!! EDF!!\n\n\"Hear us as we shout at the top of our lungs. Be calm, be bold and raise your guns!\"", "timestamp_created": 1587407968, "timestamp_updated": 1587407968, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.633219778537750244", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 1, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "67700047", "author": {"steamid": "76561198159586494", "personaname": "SaltyApple", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/omer_alnajjar/", "num_games_owned": 410, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 11595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2175, "last_played": 1771858822, "avatar": "7b0c8b6773ed4b3fe068492c531efbb06fb5fac9"}, "language": "english", "review": "so far i'm enjoying the game so much, although I still miss some things that were in EDF 4.1 but only very small things and they doesn't effect the actual gameplay, things like songs and the dumb things the soldiers says all the time.\nI like the game when it interact with you \n\n\nsmall note the air raider voice actors when it comes to artillery and air strike the voicing is meh which made the character is not as much fun as in 4.1\n\nedit, just finished the game and damn that must be the best feeling i have ever had the ending was truly amazing i felt everything", "timestamp_created": 1587405072, "timestamp_updated": 1588762506, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_durin